19868::$$$message_0162_0000_0000$$$::The courtyard is empty.[lr]::
19869::$$$message_0162_0000_0001$$$::The house of God rests, bereft of visitors.[lr]::
19870::$$$message_0162_0000_0002$$$::...This place is far from the Earth.[lr]::
19871::$$$message_0162_0000_0003$$$::It is a bewildering place of confession, from which Heaven is even more distant.::
19872::$$$message_0162_0001_0000$$$::A girl I don't know is waiting at the church.[lr]::
19873::$$$message_0162_0001_0001$$$::Whether this is our first or last meeting means nothing in this place.[lr]::
19874::$$$message_0162_0001_0002$$$::She never existed here. Just like him, everywhere yet nowhere at all.[lr]::
19875::$$$message_0162_0001_0003$$$::Here, there is no such thing as "before" or "after."[lr]::
19876::$$$message_0162_0001_0004$$$::If I recall, I'm here because...::ç'